Project\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to the map using a GeoJSON file.","type":"text"}],"title":"Using GeoJSON with a line style layer","kind":"article","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/linestylelayerexample","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/WebAPIDataExample":{"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/webapidataexample","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Showing data from an API with custom styling and interaction"}],"type":"topic","title":"Showing data from an API","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample"}}}